{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vagrant Fury",
    "steam_appid": 881260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/05ac4ab9e28c0d0e8560cbd8a784ed5a.avif?t=1540816834\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/1e08340f9f6aa77e50b70c264514ff77.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Vagrant Fury is many things: a no-frills side-shooter, a dark tale of redemption, a homage to the 80's looks and sounds... But above all, if you're the kind that likes a casual action game with artistic cutscreens and its fair share of dialogue boxes, Vagrant Fury may be for you! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/dbf476cc3b94cc2de74cb1b27ac6dcce.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>VectorGoat Games is a small shop of hard-working humanoids (and the odd xenomorph), all of them with a passion for game development.   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/cfc490756199f08231cfab0fa1eb0775.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>A secret past! A plot full of twists and surprises! A hero's path, tragic but inspiring! Clich\u00e9s you can trust! \u2014 (Action and Sci-fi Tropes Certified) <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/f2a2323bf30c7a12b64d57e1ff6e2fd0.avif?t=1540816834\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/9d5e5446d729b71246bd9f6645a8c810.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Harnessing the power of computers salvaged from our local dumpster, we're able to offer you the most advanced voxel graphics on the market in 1989. VoxelPower\u2122 \u2014 Because Pixel is Dead! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/4bcbd4df7ecc8f9d0d3add84f240abc3.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Also: remember when music was good? Yeah, us too \u2014 that's why we have an awesome synthwave soundtrack! Synthwave - where cheese and greatness collide! Synthwave makes Vagrant Fury enjoyable even with the screen turned off.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/05ac4ab9e28c0d0e8560cbd8a784ed5a.avif?t=1540816834\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/1e08340f9f6aa77e50b70c264514ff77.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Vagrant Fury is many things: a no-frills side-shooter, a dark tale of redemption, a homage to the 80's looks and sounds... But above all, if you're the kind that likes a casual action game with artistic cutscreens and its fair share of dialogue boxes, Vagrant Fury may be for you! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/dbf476cc3b94cc2de74cb1b27ac6dcce.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>VectorGoat Games is a small shop of hard-working humanoids (and the odd xenomorph), all of them with a passion for game development.   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/cfc490756199f08231cfab0fa1eb0775.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>A secret past! A plot full of twists and surprises! A hero's path, tragic but inspiring! Clich\u00e9s you can trust! \u2014 (Action and Sci-fi Tropes Certified) <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/f2a2323bf30c7a12b64d57e1ff6e2fd0.avif?t=1540816834\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/9d5e5446d729b71246bd9f6645a8c810.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Harnessing the power of computers salvaged from our local dumpster, we're able to offer you the most advanced voxel graphics on the market in 1989. VoxelPower\u2122 \u2014 Because Pixel is Dead! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/881260/extras/4bcbd4df7ecc8f9d0d3add84f240abc3.webp?t=1540816834\" /></div><br>Also: remember when music was good? Yeah, us too \u2014 that's why we have an awesome synthwave soundtrack! Synthwave - where cheese and greatness collide! Synthwave makes Vagrant Fury enjoyable even with the screen turned off.",
    "short_description": "Vagrant Fury is a casual arcade shooter inspired by the 80's and 90's, with a powered up soundtrack and visual style. It's like a weekend afternoon action movie: full of explosions and psycho villains, but laid back at the same time. Try to spot all the movie references!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cVagrant Fury is a quite fun twin-stick side-scrolling action shooter with different weapons for each level and voxel graphics.\u201d<br>IndieGems<br><br>\u201cVagrant fury sets you in a 90's styled game, in an 80's time. In this action side-shooter game you'll find many nice movie references. Defend yourself from enemies with weapons from a rifle to an RPG\u201d<br>Press Start to Play<br>",
